# GestureKeys environment configuration (OPTIONAL)
#
# The app currently does NOT require any environment variables — runtime
# options are passed as CLI flags (see run_gesturekeys.ps1 and
# `python gesture_keyboard.py --help`).
#
# This file documents the convention for future configuration. To use it,
# copy to `.env` (which is git-ignored) and load it yourself before launch.
# Nothing here is read automatically yet.

# Backend API host / port (defaults: 127.0.0.1 / 8000)
# GESTUREKEYS_HOST=127.0.0.1
# GESTUREKEYS_PORT=8000

# Preferred camera index (-1 = auto / laptop default)
# GESTUREKEYS_CAMERA=-1
